  "prefLabel": "He-P 4071.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4071.02 Scope. The rules of this part shall apply to generators of low-level radioactive waste in the state of New Hampshire who export the waste by transfer to an authorized recipient as provided in He-P 4030.16.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4062-4097.html"
